# Goal worktree scratch (personal, per-worktree, never committed --
# managing-goal-hub convention). This is the real, shared enforcement;
# .git/info/exclude is local-only and does not stop `git add -A` on a
# fresh clone/worktree from re-tracking it, which is how it kept leaking
# into commit history and causing rebase conflicts across goal branches.
/GOAL.md